{"id":2720950,"shortDescription":"Un jardinero es contratado para mantener un jardín. Parece fácil, pero curiosamente faltan varias herramientas… y el dueño del jardín no está porque vive demasiado lejos. Quizá encuentres herramientas nuevas en la misteriosa ciudad, o puede que sus habitantes sepan algo sobre las desaparecidas…","developers":["Sokpop Collective","Tom van den Boogaart"],"publishers":["Sokpop Collective"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"4 OCT 2024","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776246322","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_744d53665c53804bc83dda251a350104e3478cff.600x338.jpg?t=1776246322","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_744d53665c53804bc83dda251a350104e3478cff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776246322"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_760d74c822d8004d30edbd86eefb731b7bae84b4.600x338.jpg?t=1776246322","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_760d74c822d8004d30edbd86eefb731b7bae84b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776246322"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_5e4d34cc7a01748e3cdac2fa355624eacc95db21.600x338.jpg?t=1776246322","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_5e4d34cc7a01748e3cdac2fa355624eacc95db21.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776246322"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_cddd4069a11c9ce2d4f0043512ea4becc9795aca.600x338.jpg?t=1776246322","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720950/ss_cddd4069a11c9ce2d4f0043512ea4becc9795aca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776246322"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass